    "created_at": "2016-05-20T07:09:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-20T07:09:48Z",
    "body": "Given the imprecise language the current text is probably roughly accurate. The event object is part of a task, which is in a queue associated with the target. However, the problem is that we cannot have an event object before we know the target since it's realm and such will be wrong.\n\nSo I guess we really need to start defining serialization and deserialization of objects.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
