    "created_at": "2017-09-29T11:28:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-29T11:28:41Z",
    "body": "I said on IRC yesterday that this did not get fixed, but I obviously missed something then since it did. The new language at https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/web-messaging.html#dom-messageport-postmessage makes use of the new serialize and deserialize concepts and seems perfectly clear.",
